WEBVTT

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:23.120
You fool! Damn it!

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:24.380
Open up!

00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:26.020
Come, damn it!

00:01:27.230 --> 00:01:28.530
Damn it! Damn it!

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:29.480
Damn it! Damn it!

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:30.780
Can you hear me?

00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:32.000
You deaf!?

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:34.510
How long do you plan to keep me here?

00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:35.800
Open up!

00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:43.120
Open up, damn it!

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:47.830
I can't take it anymore!

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:49.330
Look! Do you still think I'm sick, you horse doctor!?

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:51.170
I got lots of energy left!

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:53.710
Hey! Do something!

00:01:54.110 --> 00:01:56.700
The bed is broken, fix it!

00:01:58.310 --> 00:02:00.470
Get it back to how it was!

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:04.730
Bring me some food already, you fool!

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:10.240
For the Sake of Tomorrow #2:

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:14.090
With the right straight and left jab...

00:02:14.090 --> 00:02:18.720
break the opponent's stance and cause him to show you his back.

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:21.820
Without letting him get close, go with the right straight.

00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:27.550
But old man, even if Joe gets out of the hospital, he'll be taken away again, right?

00:02:27.550 --> 00:02:28.460
Hey, old man.

00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:32.070
He won't be released immediately.

00:02:32.070 --> 00:02:34.470
The next place he is going to be at is the holding facility.

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:37.080
Damn, that's no fun.

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:38.470
So we can only meet with him for a short while then?

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:41.980
Even then, it'll only be for two or three minutes.

00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:46.120
But as long as we know Joe is alive, that's fine with me.

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:48.860
Sorry for keeping you waiting, it's about time.

00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:49.990
Shall we go?

00:02:58.210 --> 00:02:59.510
It's Joe!

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:01.120
Joe!

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:05.740
Joe! How are you doing?

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:11.950
Hey, did you read my letter?

00:03:11.950 --> 00:03:14.600
For the Sake of Tomorrow #1, did you read it?

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:17.850
Once you've mastered the left jab,

00:03:17.850 --> 00:03:20.120
this is next.

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:22.600
A right straight after the left jab.

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:26.110
It shouldn't be difficult for you.

00:03:26.110 --> 00:03:29.460
Read what's inside as soon as you reach your destination.

00:03:30.570 --> 00:03:35.580
It's written poorly, but I wrote it in a hurry so please excuse me.

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:39.080
Joe!

00:03:41.510 --> 00:03:42.510
Joe.

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:43.780
You...

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:49.050
Damn you, how dare you put me in a place like this!

00:03:49.050 --> 00:03:50.280
You bastard!

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:52.400
What are you doing?

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:55.430
What boxing? What letters?

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:54.950
<i>Stop it!</i>

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:55.540
<i>Stop it!!</i>

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:57.070
Don't make me laugh.

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:59.310
I won't box.

00:03:59.310 --> 00:04:00.930
Just you watch.

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:04.550
Who is going to listen to you?

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:06.360
Damn you!

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:07.650
Damn you, old man.

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:11.200
Just remember, once I leave the holding facility,

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:13.160
the first thing I'll do is knock your teeth out!

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:14.610
Get ready.

00:04:14.610 --> 00:04:16.900
You understand, you fool!?

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:48.530
Now, go in.

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:51.700
What a smelly place.

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:54.840
What's with this dirty color?

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:56.220
Can't you do anything about this?

00:04:56.220 --> 00:04:57.260
Don't fuss around.

00:04:57.260 --> 00:04:59.630
I can't make any new friends with this.

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:01.060
What are you saying?

00:05:01.060 --> 00:05:04.500
What do you think this holding facility is?

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:08.570
Understand? You will be standing trial in two weeks.

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:11.630
Reflect on your crimes in the meantime.

00:05:11.630 --> 00:05:15.010
If you do it seriously, you might be able to leave early.

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:15.010
<i>Hey, old man.</i>

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:16.730
Don't be slow.

00:05:16.730 --> 00:05:18.350
Seriously.

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:19.220
Hey, wait.

00:05:22.530 --> 00:05:24.230
Now, go in.

00:05:24.230 --> 00:05:26.230
Ah, here they are.

00:05:26.650 --> 00:05:27.390
Hi.

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:28.920
Here is the new guy, Yabuki Joe.

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:31.030
Everyone, take good care of him.

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:34.560
You can call me Joe.

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:35.230
Nice to meet you.

00:05:37.180 --> 00:05:41.250
By the way, is the meal not ready yet? Dinner?

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:42.290
Hey.

00:05:43.590 --> 00:05:46.250
See, I'm so hungry; I can't bear it.

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:47.230
Not yet?

00:06:05.120 --> 00:06:07.420
What? Wh-What's wrong with you guys?

00:06:07.420 --> 00:06:08.850
Shut up.

00:06:11.950 --> 00:06:13.030
What should we do, Boss?

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:19.260
What, are you the new guy?

00:06:19.260 --> 00:06:20.270
Are you the boss?

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:21.240
Nice to meet you.

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:23.640
Is that your greeting?

00:06:23.640 --> 00:06:24.930
Never mind.

00:06:24.930 --> 00:06:27.020
Take good care of him.

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:30.550
Then, let him eat the twisted stick or something first?

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:30.250
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:06:30.550 --> 00:06:33.070
Twisted stick? That's fine!

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:35.870
Thank you.

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:38.060
You're going to let me eat something? Thank you.

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:41.160
It's nothing to be thankful for.

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:43.250
Don't hold back, just eat it.

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:44.750
Is that right?

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:46.680
Then I won't hold back.

00:06:48.270 --> 00:06:51.270
So then, where is the twisted stick?

00:06:51.780 --> 00:06:52.770
Take this!

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:53.620
You bastard!

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:55.640
Dammit!

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:56.680
Wh-What are you doing?

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:58.690
Let go!

00:06:58.690 --> 00:07:00.920
Damn it, let go! Get off!

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:01.990
You coward.

00:07:03.050 --> 00:07:04.540
Ouch! Wh-What are you doing?

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:05.660
Ouch!

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:07.480
Let go! Let go!

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:11.310
Take that!

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:15.130
Don't hold back and eat.

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:16.740
This is the twisted stick.

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:19.220
He can't speak now,

00:07:19.220 --> 00:07:22.260
so next will be the bone twister.

00:07:22.260 --> 00:07:23.760
All right, let's go.

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:24.500
Pull!

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:28.610
Pull!

00:07:30.770 --> 00:07:32.890
Hey, put more of your strength into it!

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:38.770
What are you standing around for?

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:43.230
Come massage my back or something, fools!

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:46.780
Sorry.

00:07:51.540 --> 00:07:54.720
Here we go! We can go further!

00:08:00.300 --> 00:08:02.360
Stop that twister thing.

00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:05.180
Try the parachute team next.

00:08:05.180 --> 00:08:07.890
P-Parachute team?

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:10.360
Hold him still.

00:08:10.360 --> 00:08:13.090
We might get hurt if we land in the wrong spot.

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:15.410
How about here?

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:16.600
Yeah, it should be all right.

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:20.010
All right, let's start!

00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:22.650
You bastard!

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:26.160
Hey, next one! Continue after me!

00:08:27.160 --> 00:08:27.740
Here!

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:28.990
Take that!

00:08:32.480 --> 00:08:34.430
Hey, what are you doing!?

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:36.450
Why aren't you massaging my back!?

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:39.000
I'm sorry. I got distracted.

00:08:39.770 --> 00:08:41.010
Take that!

00:08:48.780 --> 00:08:51.920
What a weak guy, he passed out already.

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:55.120
That's unfortunate.

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:58.040
He seemed energetic, but passed out quickly.

00:08:58.040 --> 00:09:00.050
It's okay. Pour some water on him.

00:09:00.050 --> 00:09:01.220
Wake him up.

00:09:01.800 --> 00:09:05.240
Then, do the parachute team again.

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:07.740
Huh, again?

00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:10.060
<i>Hey! When do you hear underlings talk back!?</i>

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:11.820
He isn't even bleeding yet.

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:13.370
Do it until his bones break!

00:09:13.370 --> 00:09:15.220
Hey! Pour some water on him!

00:09:15.220 --> 00:09:17.470
{be1}Lots of water!

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:23.220
What? I know, I know.

00:09:23.220 --> 00:09:25.840
Listen, stop for today.

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:27.620
Come tomorrow, tomorrow.

00:09:27.620 --> 00:09:30.090
If you drink that much, your body will break.

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:32.370
What are you saying, you bastard?

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:34.600
Why would I listen to you?

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:37.400
Telling me not to drink...

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:43.020
The number of stars.

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:49.500
Did old man Danpei give up on Joe already?

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:52.070
It's not like that; he's just angry.

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:53.960
Isn't that the same thing?

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:55.230
It's not the same! It's not the same at all!

00:09:55.230 --> 00:09:56.570
It's not the same! It's not the same at all!

00:09:56.580 --> 00:09:59.030
What trivial things are you talking about?

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:00.450
Now, everyone,

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:01.800
let's go back.

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:04.750
Hey, hey, Tarou-chan.

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:07.750
Tomorrow, let's go to the holding facility.

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:10.010
Maybe we'll be able to meet Joe then.

00:10:10.010 --> 00:10:11.100
That's right.

00:10:11.100 --> 00:10:13.780
It's because of what Danpei said today that Joe ended up like that.

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:16.070
Let's go by ourselves.

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:18.090
That's right.

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:19.280
Shall we go?

00:10:20.280 --> 00:10:22.610
But let's keep it a secret from the old man.

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:35.160
The pleasant sound of festivals...

00:10:39.930 --> 00:10:46.230
I have strong allies like you.

00:10:51.590 --> 00:10:55.340
Danpei-sama is back!

00:10:56.490 --> 00:10:59.090
The master is back!

00:11:00.030 --> 00:11:02.610
Come meet me, damn it!

00:11:10.220 --> 00:11:12.520
Old man, what are you doing?

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:19.750
Joe, you...

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:22.670
Jump rope 3000 times, already done.

00:11:22.670 --> 00:11:24.530
I'm so sweaty.

00:11:25.170 --> 00:11:26.650
Now, the sandbag is next.

00:11:26.650 --> 00:11:28.110
Help me, old man.

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:36.350
Now, hold it tight.

00:11:37.310 --> 00:11:38.340
Come!

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:44.520
All right! That's it!

00:11:47.590 --> 00:11:49.450
Put your waist into it more!

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:51.990
All right, old man, don't be surprised.

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:53.480
Take that!

00:11:57.370 --> 00:11:58.740
That's great, Joe!

00:11:58.740 --> 00:12:00.540
Keep it up!

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:10.820
Joe!

00:12:21.650 --> 00:12:27.220
Damn it! Making fun of me!

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:31.760
Damn it, just you remember!

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:34.560
Damn it!

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:41.970
Watch yourself, get lost!

00:12:41.970 --> 00:12:43.800
Just like that!

00:12:46.540 --> 00:12:49.350
Stop it. Stop.

00:12:49.350 --> 00:12:52.250
For someone like you, I'll go first!

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:54.630
Fool!

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:58.710
Don't say such troublesome things.

00:12:59.150 --> 00:13:02.340
It feels bad just thinking about it.

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:06.180
An idiot like you, you can stay there forever!

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:07.750
Someone like you...

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:12.930
Someone like you... Just die!

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:18.940
Die! Damn it... Damn it...

00:13:26.380 --> 00:13:27.860
How was it, new guy?

00:13:27.860 --> 00:13:30.100
The taste of the twisted stick.

00:13:32.550 --> 00:13:36.880
Now that he's awake, do the parachute team again.

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:41.490
The parachute team once again.

00:13:41.490 --> 00:13:43.020
Hold him tight.

00:13:43.020 --> 00:13:44.900
Get some water ready too.

00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:45.910
Got it?

00:13:46.730 --> 00:13:47.900
Here we go!

00:13:51.770 --> 00:13:53.590
Hey, the food service guys are here.

00:13:53.590 --> 00:13:54.390
Clean up quick.

00:14:08.100 --> 00:14:11.080
Now, here's the food you've been waiting for.

00:14:12.680 --> 00:14:14.580
Thank you.

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:18.350
We're having pork soup tonight. It's delicious.

00:14:19.590 --> 00:14:21.480
It smells yummy, right?

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:22.900
My stomach is rumbling.

00:14:22.900 --> 00:14:24.230
Yeah, so is mine.

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:28.330
The next service staff will clean up.

00:14:28.330 --> 00:14:30.080
All of you, try to get along and eat.

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:33.130
Sure, sure, we know, sir. We'll be good.

00:14:35.860 --> 00:14:37.360
Yay, it's food time!

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:50.660
Food!

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:54.320
It's delicious!

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:01.880
Hey, Boss.

00:15:07.060 --> 00:15:08.310
Food... Food, is it?

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:09.580
Food... Food, is it?

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:11.850
Hey, let me eat too.

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:16.470
Th-This guy, after being beat up that much, he wants food...

00:15:18.240 --> 00:15:19.880
Not so fast.

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:23.790
Hey! What are you doing?

00:15:23.790 --> 00:15:24.740
Isn't that my food?

00:15:25.490 --> 00:15:26.990
Hey, new guy.

00:15:26.990 --> 00:15:30.740
Seems like you don't have any manners at all.

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:35.180
Your first meal must be given to the boss.

00:15:35.180 --> 00:15:37.670
You're not a very considerate guy.

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:40.900
If you understand, greet everyone again.

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:43.680
"Hi everyone, nice to meet you."

00:15:45.530 --> 00:15:49.720
I had wanted to do this after we had a pleasant meal.

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:53.800
But I'm so angry, I can't even say such nice things.

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:54.650
You...

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:58.640
Oh, don't be bowing your heads now, begging me to eat.

00:15:58.640 --> 00:15:59.740
It's already too late.

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:02.670
I'm already completely pissed off.

00:16:02.670 --> 00:16:09.860
So no matter what you say, you won't be able to calm me down now.

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:12.740
Just see how far you can get.

00:16:15.250 --> 00:16:17.250
You got guts.

00:16:18.770 --> 00:16:21.700
I wanted to start with you first.

00:16:21.700 --> 00:16:23.760
Well, until you're finished with your meal,

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:26.220
I'll deal with the underlings around first.

00:16:27.910 --> 00:16:32.010
Even though you're doing your best just to stand up.

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:34.220
You lowlifes!

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:36.500
What are you waiting for!?

00:16:36.500 --> 00:16:38.600
Go fight him already!

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:40.130
Fools!

00:16:40.130 --> 00:16:41.420
All right, new guy.

00:16:41.420 --> 00:16:44.350
You were talking shit just now.

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:46.740
Shall we do the parachute team or something again?

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:49.580
That was pretty fun.

00:16:49.580 --> 00:16:51.250
Let me try that next time too.

00:16:51.250 --> 00:16:52.740
What are you saying!

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:56.170
Damn you.

00:17:26.220 --> 00:17:27.910
Hey, pig, are you done with your food yet?

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:32.560
You're doing better than I thought you would.

00:17:32.560 --> 00:17:33.910
I'm impressed.

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:36.410
You can praise me later.

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:37.840
I'm hungry.

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:40.130
Can we finish this quickly?

00:17:40.130 --> 00:17:40.910
Hey.

00:17:41.390 --> 00:17:43.020
Poor guy.

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:46.970
This kid, he doesn't know what real hell is like.

00:17:46.970 --> 00:17:49.640
Don't you value your life?

00:18:13.060 --> 00:18:15.560
It's troublesome, but can you get up?

00:18:15.560 --> 00:18:18.320
You haven't calmed the worm in my stomach yet.

00:18:19.120 --> 00:18:21.670
All right, all right, do your best.

00:18:22.570 --> 00:18:27.560
Now, shall we try old man Danpei's teachings in action here?

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:29.760
For the Sake of Tomorrow #1: Jab.

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:31.480
Damn you...

00:18:32.480 --> 00:18:36.480
I-I will kill you! I will kill you!

00:18:36.480 --> 00:18:39.790
Stand with your elbows close to your body,

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:41.080
aim slightly inside,

00:18:41.080 --> 00:18:43.080
and punch with a drilling motion.

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:44.610
Damn you...

00:18:44.610 --> 00:18:48.070
Hit! Hit! Hit! Hit!

00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:50.970
Damn you...

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:56.030
Hit! Hit! Hit!

00:19:05.920 --> 00:19:07.830
What happened to you guys?

00:19:12.810 --> 00:19:16.220
Stand with your elbows close to your body...

00:19:16.220 --> 00:19:17.400
What's that?

00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:19.340
Aim slightly inside,

00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:22.480
and punch with a drilling motion.

00:19:22.480 --> 00:19:23.440
Hit.

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:27.810
For the Sake of Tomorrow #1: Jab.

00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:31.580
I like it, old man Danpei.

00:19:31.580 --> 00:19:33.920
Well, I'll use it when I need it.

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:36.500
What a dangerous guy.

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:39.340
I'll move you to a private cell immediately.

00:19:42.270 --> 00:19:44.540
W-We're too late?

00:19:45.110 --> 00:19:46.100
That's right.

00:19:46.100 --> 00:19:48.400
There's no use in lecturing a guy like him.

00:19:48.400 --> 00:19:52.120
He made a big fuss, beating his comrades almost to death,

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:53.510
and doesn't show any remorse at all for it.

00:19:53.510 --> 00:19:55.000
I can't let you meet him.

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:56.050
Go home.

00:19:56.050 --> 00:19:57.450
Go home!

00:19:57.450 --> 00:19:59.560
What did Joe do?

00:20:03.290 --> 00:20:04.790
Just as I expected.

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:08.570
I thought something like that would happen.

00:20:09.010 --> 00:20:10.350
If he continues on like this,

00:20:10.350 --> 00:20:13.610
Joe will stay imprisoned for sure.

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:18.230
Half a year, maybe longer.

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:22.420
Old man, what is "For the Sake of Tomorrow #1"?

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:24.820
Wh-What?

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:26.870
Where did you hear that?

00:20:27.250 --> 00:20:29.900
"For the Sake of Tomorrow #1."

00:20:29.900 --> 00:20:31.870
I don't really understand.

00:20:32.860 --> 00:20:36.640
When Joe made a big fuss at the holding facility, that's what he was saying.

00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:38.850
Hey, Tarou, is that true?

00:20:38.850 --> 00:20:40.010
Yeah.

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:44.470
Did Joe really say those words?

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:45.850
What's wrong with you, old man?

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:48.430
O-Old man...

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:49.510
That guy...

00:20:49.510 --> 00:20:50.820
That Joe...

00:20:50.820 --> 00:20:53.170
You read my letter.

00:20:55.190 --> 00:21:02.450
What I wrote, "For the Sake of Tomorrow #1: Left Jab." I'm sure he really did read it!

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:08.450
There's no doubt about it.

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:10.600
He really did read it.

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:13.420
Just you watch. He hasn't given up on me.

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:19.850
All right, I've decided.

00:21:19.850 --> 00:21:21.690
I'm going to write more,

00:21:21.690 --> 00:21:24.300
and I'll catch him for sure.

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:27.840
My letters will be the only thing precious in life.

00:21:28.710 --> 00:21:30.300
The only thing precious to my life.

00:21:30.760 --> 00:21:32.760
Hey, it's terrible.

00:21:32.760 --> 00:21:34.190
Everyone, come.

00:21:34.190 --> 00:21:36.910
The old man's sandbag is being washed away.

00:21:36.910 --> 00:21:37.630
What?

00:21:37.630 --> 00:21:39.620
Who would do such a terrible thing?

00:21:39.620 --> 00:21:41.320
That's so terrible.

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:44.430
Joe won't be able to practice when he gets back.

00:21:45.320 --> 00:21:46.640
Tarou-chan.

00:21:46.640 --> 00:21:48.690
Hey, Tarou-chan,

00:21:48.690 --> 00:21:50.270
come here for a second.

00:21:50.270 --> 00:21:51.390
Hey, look at this.

00:21:51.390 --> 00:21:54.750
Isn't this terrible? I wonder who did it?

00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:59.800
For the Sake of Tomorrow #2: Right Straight.

00:21:59.800 --> 00:22:03.530
With the left jab, make the enemy

00:22:04.660 --> 00:22:06.760
lose his stance.

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:09.270
Now, let's go.

00:22:17.820 --> 00:22:19.700
A right straight is

00:22:20.710 --> 00:22:23.920
putting all of your body weight into your right fist

00:22:23.920 --> 00:22:26.860
and punching straight forward.

00:22:27.620 --> 00:22:29.280
Do you understand, Joe?

00:22:29.280 --> 00:22:30.910
Read well.

00:22:30.910 --> 00:22:32.280
Carefully.

00:22:33.310 --> 00:22:38.430
After that, retreat with the same speed you struck with.

00:22:40.260 --> 00:22:42.950
We did it!

00:22:42.950 --> 00:22:46.010
Yay, we did it!

00:22:46.010 --> 00:22:50.030
All right, before Joe returns, shall I try it?

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:50.880
I'll try too!

00:22:50.880 --> 00:22:51.850
Me too!

00:22:51.850 --> 00:22:52.850
Me too!!

00:22:53.270 --> 00:22:57.780
After that, retreat with the same speed you struck with.

00:22:57.780 --> 00:23:01.600
This will become the basics of a good fight.

00:23:01.600 --> 00:23:03.390
From Tange Danpei.

00:23:05.910 --> 00:23:07.380
Understand, Joe.

00:23:08.080 --> 00:23:10.290
Look carefully.

00:23:10.900 --> 00:23:13.010
You will definitely read this.

00:23:13.010 --> 00:23:14.450
Definitely.

00:23:14.450 --> 00:23:16.300
And you will definitely master it.

00:23:16.300 --> 00:23:17.830
Definitely. Definitely!

00:23:17.830 --> 00:23:19.030
Definitely. Definitely!

00:23:35.180 --> 00:23:38.320
Joe has hit rock bottom.

00:23:38.680 --> 00:23:40.320
The ruling of the court for Joe was

00:23:40.820 --> 00:23:42.160
to send him to the juvenile reformatory.

00:23:43.300 --> 00:23:45.030
On a cold and rainy day,

00:23:45.030 --> 00:23:48.040
Joe was sent to a far away land in a paddy wagon.

00:23:49.430 --> 00:23:50.550
Now,

00:23:50.550 --> 00:23:54.000
as he has been sent to the juvenile detention center, which way is Joe's tomorrow?
